  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<para>For questions 1 - 5, simplify each expression completely. </para>
<!--Do not edit this div tag.  It must surround the interaction block-->
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="31411e4f-7669-41d2-bfa2-4c227dc837f1"><problem><para>
      <para>\(14ab^2-8ab^2\) </para>
      </para><para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(6ab^2\)</para><para> \(22ab^2\)</para><para>\(14ab^2\)</para><para> \(8ab^2\)</para></problem><solution><para>\(6ab^2\)</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is \(6ab^2\).

      </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
